{"asset_key":"ep4/gameplay_story_14601220","episode":"ep4","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"14601220","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1460122001:1":{"text":"戦況を素早く見抜き、分析するシンドバッド殿の攻撃は、きわめて的確だな。","source_cn":"辛巴达的进攻非常精准，而这是建立在他对战场及时的观察和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D997C1C03AB57F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1460122002:1":{"text":"直感的に標的を選び、冷静に相手の隙を突く。敵に包囲された状況で、局面を打開するのに効果的だ。","source_cn":"犹如直觉一般选择目标，并异常冷静地击中破绽，在被围攻时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED4F044CFA491015","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1460122003:1":{"text":"へへっ、これは母ちゃんたちに教えてもらった接舷戦（せつげんせん）の応用さ。船上戦ではもっと威力を発揮できるぜ。","source_cn":"这是妈妈们教过我的接舷战技巧，在船上作战时威力会变得更强。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x526AE6E176A94E98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1460122004:1":{"text":"ブラッディ・マリーのお二人の、攻防一体の連携はまさに完璧で、まるで隙がなかった。","source_cn":"血薇帮的二位攻防一体的联手作战浑然一体，简直毫无破绽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56EECFF2A5257DE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1460122005:1":{"text":"それこそが血の薔薇の誓約だ。あたしが仲間を守り、同時にルカの咆哮が、あたしを奮い立たせてくれるんだ。","source_cn":"这是血薇的誓约，我将守护战场的同伴。而卢卡的战吼也始终...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FA2DF4EDE1D3040","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1460122006:1":{"text":"うむ。貴殿らの戦い方は、いずれも集団戦や少数対多数の戦闘に適しているな。","source_cn":"几位的战斗，都非常适合群战或者以少对多的场合。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9D5968CA807E558","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1460122007:1":{"text":"そういうことなら、予選では挑戦者たちに、五人前後のチームを組んで挑んでもらおうか。","source_cn":"嗯，既然这样，干脆预选赛的擂台就让挑战者们自行组个五人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC943AA96E4AF3D42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1460122008:1":{"text":"具体的な形式については、戻ってからゆっくり検討しよう。","source_cn":"至于赛制，我们回去再慢慢商讨章程。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x918C0B7E79111870","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1460122009:1":{"text":"そうだな……参加資格を得た者たちには、専用の船を手配して、本戦の開催地へ送り届けよう。","source_cn":"唔，如果通过考验，我这边准备专门的船只送他们去参加大赛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE1C3B08277168B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1460122010:1":{"text":"ラスティーアンカーの風格を世に示すいい機会だ。","source_cn":"这是锈锚港正式展现风采的第一步。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4F71D71E2A3EBC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1460122011:1":{"text":"船の護衛は――いや、操縦は俺に任せてくれ！","source_cn":"那就由我来护航——不，我来开船！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43172A4BCC837FF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1460122012:1":{"text":"ふっ、あんたの実力じゃ、予選を突破できるかも怪しいな。","source_cn":"哼，就凭你这点本事，能不能通过预选还不一定呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B886DDA1908E477","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1460122013:1":{"text":"選手として参加するにせよ、船を任されるにせよ、まずはこのあたしを頷かせてからだ。","source_cn":"我可不会放水，不管你想参赛还是护航，都得过了我这关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7A4BB7CAC5D2212","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1460122014:1":{"text":"お、ってことは、ソニアさん直々に予選を担当するのか？","source_cn":"所以，预选赛这边就由索尼娅你亲自负责了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E7ABEBC58A030F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1460122015:1":{"text":"そうだな、日程を見て、ルカと交代で行うつもりだ。","source_cn":"嗯，到时看看日程，我和卢卡轮换进行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DB9EE6925B8E145","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1460122016:1":{"text":"だが、予選以降は、こちら側の出場者をまとめて引率する必要がある。万が一、外で問題を起こされては困るからな。","source_cn":"不过，预选赛后，我们这边的参赛者还是需要统一带队，否则...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ADD990516B9FAF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1460122017:1":{"text":"死海の艦隊（モルティア）の脅威が完全に消えるまで、あたしはここを離れるわけにはいかない。もし、あんたが予選を通過できたら、ルカと一緒に引率を担当してくれ。","source_cn":"我会留在这里坐镇，防止死潮舰队卷土重来，如果到时你能通...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x803D89DFB86031D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1460122018:1":{"text":"任せなって！偉大なるシンドバッド船長と、ブラッディ・マリーの鉄の拳、ルカの若頭が、外の連中に一発かましてくるからよ！","source_cn":"放心，伟大的船长辛巴达和血薇帮的铁拳卢卡会给外面的世界...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB24E9C9BADADDF54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1460122019:0":{"text":"笑い声が絶えない中、あなたたちは戦闘や試合のルールについて話し合った。","source_cn":"在笑声中，你们又探讨了不少战斗与比赛的规则。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99EA4B238C489844","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1460122020:1":{"text":"ソニアが会議に向かう時間になり、楽しい語らいもひとまずお開きになった。","source_cn":"直到索尼娅不得不前去处理会议，愉快的交谈才暂时告一段落。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D8CA41C9CA28CAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1460122021:0":{"text":"そう言えば、シンドバッドさんが、特産品も持って行くと言ってましたね。","source_cn":"刚刚辛巴达还说，会顺便带上特产货物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB959EDA1589E7B82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1460122022:1":{"text":"もし大会が成功すれば、荒涼の砂漠の観光が賑わうだけでなく、ラスティーアンカーの復興にもつながりますね！","source_cn":"这样一来，如果大赛能成功举办，不止荒角沙漠会迎来游客，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x640CFA98160DEDCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1460122023:0":{"text":"でも、死海の艦隊率いるグレイヴボーンたちの脅威がまだ去っていないのよね……","source_cn":"可惜这边还是要防着死潮舰队的那些亡灵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E6395BE2A6C25AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:32:1460122023":{"text":"でも、死海の艦隊率いるグレイヴボーンたちの脅威がまだ去っていないのよね……","source_cn":"可惜这边还是要防着死潮舰队的那些亡灵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E6395BE2A6C25AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1460122024:1":{"text":"拙者、古い手記でバンティス帝国という名を目にしたことがあるが――","source_cn":"我曾经有所耳闻，但只是在很古老的手记里提到过班题斯帝国...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A520B74E1D61B8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1460122025:1":{"text":"グレイヴボーンに関しては、せいぜい伝承や怪談話で、その存在を知っているだけだ。","source_cn":"至于亡灵这种生物，我的了解就只来自于传奇故事——或者说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECC329E9B845CE40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1460122026:1":{"text":"実際の彼らも、怪談話に出てくる内容とあまり変わりませんが……そうだ！","source_cn":"其实鬼故事里写的基本也差不离……对了！我有个主意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x406A7266557DCC21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1460122027:1":{"text":"外の世界との交流を通じて、グレイヴボーンのイメージを改善するなら――","source_cn":"说到想要与外界接触，改善亡灵形象，友善的亡灵来——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AE24485372A6EB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:42:1460122027":{"text":"外の世界との交流を通じて、グレイヴボーンのイメージを改善するなら――","source_cn":"说到想要与外界接触，改善亡灵形象，友善的亡灵来——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AE24485372A6EB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1460122028:1":{"text":"でも、あそこの方たちは静かな暮らしを望んでいるようですし。あんな、賑やかな大会に参加してくれるでしょうか？","source_cn":"不过，他们都喜好宁静，深居简出，不一定会答应参加这种热...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0194418C36F20B52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44: